# Server-only. Never expose these to the client (no NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix).
# Used by app/api/handwriting (reading handwritten prescriptions) and app/api/explain (plain-language rephrasing).
# Both are OPTIONAL: without them the app still works — prescriptions are typed or picked from the medicine
# list, and explanations use the built-in template.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Model id for the Anthropic API (the code never hard-codes one), e.g. claude-opus-5-5.
ANTHROPIC_MODEL=
